<title>PAKISTAN: PAKISTAN TO AUCTION FEDERAL INVESTMENT BONDS.</title>
<headline>PAKISTAN TO AUCTION FEDERAL INVESTMENT BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Monday it had invited tenders for Tuesday and Wednesday for the sale of federal investment bonds.</p>
<p>The auction results will be announced on Friday, a bank statement said. Successful bidders must deposit the amount of accepted bids on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom (9221) 5685192; Fax 5673428</p>
